  "goodToKnow": "Gewerblich means commercial or relating to trade: gewerbliche Nutzung (commercial use), ein gewerblicher Händler (as opposed to a private seller, important for consumer rights). Das Gewerbe is a trade or business; to become self-employed in most trades, you need a Gewerbeanmeldung at the local Gewerbeamt. Municipalities collect die Gewerbesteuer, their main source of income. Das Gewerbegebiet is an industrial estate."
